OL,3,ANew evidence gives family hope after
OL,4,Adeath in Spain
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour years after watching his brother
OL,7,Fdie in his arms, Maximilian White
OL,8,Fbelieves new evidence could help him
OL,9,Fget answers.
OL,11,FTobias White-Sansom, a father-of-two
OL,12,Ffrom Nottingham, died in a Spanish
OL,13,Fhospital in July 2022, five days after
OL,14,Fa night out in Magaluf, and his family
OL,15,Fbelieves the way security and police
OL,16,Fofficers handled him that night led to
OL,17,Fhis death.
