OL,3,ANew evidence gives family hope after
OL,4,Adeath in Spain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA blood spatter report and a court
OL,7,Forder received by the family this month
OL,8,Fhave reignited their hopes that
OL,9,Fcriminal proceedings could commence in
OL,10,Fthe Spanish courts.
OL,12,FWhite told the BBC: "I won't stop until
OL,13,Fwe get justice for Toby."
